    "body": "The directory-suite prerequisite is incomplete on upstream/main 6f900b123fa53fe2c0098b7e734e5c4cd307775a.\n\nIn xtask/src/assets.rs, suites_for reads only tests/{b}.rs at lines 49-51. It does not scan directory-suite modules.\nxtask/src/quick.rs supports directory suites, but the asset reader still needs that support.\n\nThis issue requires both before the rule takes effect. I stopped without a claim or repository changes.\n",
